{
  "checks": [
    "empty review workspace exposes one import action without an empty project selector",
    "real CSV import validates UTF-8, previews quoted data and persists the original in SQLite",
    "review defaults hide filters, model settings, import/export controls and analysis records",
    "chat model selection belongs to chat analysis and deletion is separated from exports",
    "the first primary click only selects a batch and a separate explicit click prepares analysis",
    "batch preparation uses the real conversation handoff in Chat mode without invoking a model",
    "real API rejects unfinished/wrong-batch output and preserves manual edits when applying the batch",
    "native save dispatch exports complete original bytes, formula-safe labeled CSV and an evidence report",
    "reload retains datasets/results and a stale manual write preserves its draft on conflict",
    "a successful write settles a superseded list spinner and a late refresh cannot lock the workspace",
    "note checks display support/review signals, reveal the exact minimal payload and reuse a saved result without another call",
    "historical v1 records remain readable without triggering a paid upgrade",
    "pure recommendations show not-applicable and never display a misleading support percentage",
    "uncertain factual existence hides even a 99-percent support answer",
    "a verification response arriving after navigation cannot install an old dialog or change the current view",
    "provider errors and timeouts never become negative answers and intermediate probabilities remain uncertain",
    "light desktop and narrow dark layouts retain the controls without document overflow",
    "a deleted source reports a recoverable error while the saved analysis stays available",
    "a late prepare response cannot navigate or fill a draft after the user leaves",
    "refresh recovers from a remotely deleted selection and discovers another client's dataset"
